## Inter‑Layer Harmony
Layers DNA (3 heads), RNA (5 heads), Protein (11 heads) synchronize via phase shifts (0.0, 0.05, 0.1) and inter‑layer harmony weights (0.5, 0.5, 0.3). Correlations between layers exceed 0.94.

